# Advance Tomb Raider: The Prophecy into an active in-engine snowy area.
repeat Start 120 120 12 5
repeat A 180 120 30 5
repeat Down 2400 120 6 8
repeat A 2520 120 10 5
repeat Right 4200 120 6 8
repeat A 4320 120 12 5
repeat A 6000 180 12 5
at 7600 Right 900
at 9000 Down 900
at 10400 Left 900
at 11800 Up 900
press 13200 A
at 15000 B,Right 900
at 16800 A,Down 900
press 19000 A
